D_{QQ,\alpha\beta}&=k_{\!B}T\Bigl(M_{11,\alpha\beta}+M_{22,\alpha\beta}
-M_{12,\alpha\beta}-M_{21,\alpha\beta}\Bigr),\\[4pt]
D_{RQ,\alpha\beta}&=D_{QR,\beta\alpha}
=\frac{k_{\!B}T}{2}\Bigl(M_{12,\alpha\beta}+M_{22,\alpha\beta}
